    "description": "task-execution-test-workflow, task-target-workflow, extended-tasks-test-workflow. Sadece happy path. Kaynak: api-tests/task-execution/task-execution.http.\n\n**Timer Task (tip 9):** Ana zincirde script-processing-state sonrasinda timer-wait-state bulunur. Bu state'in cikis transition'i `triggerType: 2` (scheduled) + `ITimerMapping` (TimerScheduleMapping.csx) ile 3 sn bekler. Adim 1 testleri parent attributes.timerStartedAt ile (Date.now() - ts) >= 2500 ms olarak Timer Task'in gercekten beklemis oldugunu dogrular. Condition Task (tip 8) tum auto transition rule'larinda (AlwaysTrueRule) dolayli olarak uretilir.\n\n**Child instance variable senkronu:** Adim 1 (sync start) ve Adim 3 (functions/data) Tests script'leri parent instance data'dan (kok veya attributes) collection variable doldurur: taskExecStartedTargetId, taskExecSubprocessId, taskExecSubflowInstanceId; istege bagli hedef workflow key: childWorkflowStartFlow, childWorkflowSubprocess, childWorkflowSubflow (varsayilan task-target-workflow). Adim 3a–3d zincirleri bu variable'larla StartFlow / SubProcess / Subflow hedeflerinin state, data ve instance GET isteklerini calistirir.\n\nB2 bagimsiz hedef workflow: targetWorkflow + targetInstanceId.",
